// [👤compose📚js🗃️sketchpad💻design🔖imports🔖panels🔖canvas🔖scene🪨applyhighlighttoloadedscene](repo://p/u/compose/b/l/js/fd/org/sketchpad/f/Design.tsx/s/Imports/s/Panels/s/Canvas/s/Scene/d/i/applyHighlightToLoadedScene)
