/**
 * [👤compose📚js🗃️sketchpad💻sketchpad🔖store🔖canvas🛠️layouterrorboundary](composerepo://p/u/compose/b/l/js/fd/org/sketchpad/f/Sketchpad.tsx/s/Store/s/Canvas/d/i/LayoutErrorBoundary)
